      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REMEMBRANCE TIME (5) settled close to the pace then went to the front and finished the race off in style to take out a 2240m race at this track last start, adding to her fine second the run prior at this track. Must raise the bar but another win is on the cards. MISS MUSCLE (2) did a good job to finish second two starts ago then registered a commanding win last start, scoring by 8 metres over 2240m at this track. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Taking on a better field but she is up to the task. PHOENIX REX (6) made it two wins from as many outings when he scored by 4 metres last start despite breaking in the run over 2240m at this track. It doesn't get any easier but he is going well enough to be competitive. MAJARO GIRL (1) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when she broke and finished 18 metres away in seventh over 2240m at this track. No excuses from this advantageous draw.",
